2
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:06,000
The Last Son is a western, action, adventure film directed by Tim Sutton.

3
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Isaac LeMay, a murderous outlaw, learns he is cursed by a
prophecy: one of his children will kill him.

4
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
To prevent this, he hunts down each of his estranged
children, including long-lost son Cal.

5
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
With bounty hunters and Sheriff Solomon on his tail, LeMay must
find a way to stop his children and end the curse.

6
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Isaac LeMay, played by Sam Worthington.

7
